n class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"exclusion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"period\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"semiannual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"deadline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"28th of month after period end\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"record_retention_years\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-6050W\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"axis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment_channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"exclusion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"logic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AND\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"min_gross\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"min_transactions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"applies_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TPSO_only\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"period\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"annual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"deadline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"01-31\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"record_retention_years\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>logic</code> 显式写成 AND 而不是依赖代码里的比较方向，是为了让「少且小」与「多且大」这两种相反的语义在配置里一眼可辨，减少新增法域时的复制粘贴事故。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>英国、加拿大、澳大利亚、新西兰把 OECD 2020 示范规则本地化，结构亲近 DAC7，差异在变量层。</li>\n<li>英国 SI 2023/817 采用引用式采纳，实体定义直接指向示范规则，程序层补充电子报送、1 月 31 日期限与五年记录保存。</li>\n<li>英国第 3 条要求保存的是「尽职调查过程记录」而非仅卖家档案，系统须留存字段来源与核实时点。</li>\n<li>澳大利亚按半年报送，时间轴与年度报送法域不同，聚合层必须参数化。</li>\n<li>欧盟/英国是「少且小则排除」，美国 TPSO 是「多且大才应报」，方向相反，不可共用表达式。</li>\n<li>多法域实现应把法域规则作为配置数据，显式表达门槛逻辑方向。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"英/加/澳新等法域报送矩阵","id":"英-加-澳新等法域报送矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：同一骨架的本地化变量","id":"核心概念-同一骨架的本地化变量"},{"level":2,"text":"英国：把示范规则写进成文法","id":"英国-把示范规则写进成文法"},{"level":2,"text":"澳大利亚：半年报与不同的时间轴","id":"澳大利亚-半年报与不同的时间轴"},{"level":2,"text":"加拿大的路径","id":"加拿大的路径"},{"level":2,"text":"横向对照表","id":"横向对照表"},{"level":2,"text":"一个可复用的判定结构","id":"一个可复用的判定结构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"美国 1099-K 门槛与平台报送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-seller-income-tax-reporting-dac7/platform-reporting-rules/us-1099k-threshold-evolution"},"next":{"title":"卖家/实体/控益人身份采集（CPRS）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-seller-income-tax-reporting-dac7/seller-tax-identity-due-diligence/seller-identity-controlling-person"}}